sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CacheI as CacheInterceptor
    participant Disk as okhttp3.Cache
    participant Strat as CacheStrategy
    participant Next as Connect plus CallServer

    CacheI->>Disk: get(request)
    Disk-->>CacheI: cacheCandidate or null
    CacheI->>Strat: Factory.compute
    alt cache hit networkRequest is null
        Strat-->>CacheI: cacheResponse only
        CacheI-->>CacheI: return cached Response
    else cache miss cacheResponse is null
        Strat-->>CacheI: networkRequest only
        CacheI->>Next: proceed(networkRequest)
        Next-->>CacheI: network Response
        CacheI->>Disk: put if cacheable
        CacheI-->>CacheI: return maybe wrapping cacheWritingSource
    else conditional GET both non-null
        Strat-->>CacheI: networkRequest plus cacheResponse
        CacheI->>Next: proceed with If-None-Match
        alt 304 Not Modified
            Next-->>CacheI: 304
            CacheI->>Disk: update headers
            CacheI-->>CacheI: merged cached body
        else full new body
            Next-->>CacheI: 200
            CacheI->>Disk: put new response
        end
    else only-if-cached and nothing usable
        CacheI-->>CacheI: 504 Unsatisfiable Request
    end
